{"data": [{"author_id": "2100385329824116736", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:06:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113753833675407528"], "id": "2113753833675407528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10 月 22 日，AI 行业同时收到了“最大的钱”和“最硬的墙”，值得一次拆透。先说钱：DeepSeek 约 150 亿美元融资收尾（Reuters 10-22），从 500 亿人民币目标直接翻倍，投资者多为国资背景，9 月聘中信证券筹备科创板 IPO——AI 史上最大私募轮之一。再说墙：美国财政部同日提议 COINS Act", "url": "https://x.com/qihanblmg/status/2113753833675407528"}, {"author_id": "153498077", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113752336199746021"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 131, "start": 115, "tag": "revistacultivar"}], "urls": [{"description": "Propriedades aprovadas no programa ABR também mantêm certificação internacional da Better Cotton Initiative (BCI)", "display_url": "revistacultivar.com.br/noticias/minas…", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://revistacultivar.com.br/noticias/minas-gerais-tem-13-fazendas-de-algodao-certificadas", "images": [{"height": 900, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113752386929917952/fTpHq09q?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1250}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113752386929917952/fTpHq09q?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 133, "status": 200, "title": "Minas Gerais tem 13 fazendas de algodão certificadas - Revista Cultivar", "unwound_url": "https://revistacultivar.com.br/noticias/minas-gerais-tem-13-fazendas-de-algodao-certificadas", "url": "https://t.co/IvGy5rBhI8"}]}, "id": "2113752336199746021", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 151, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Propriedades aprovadas no programa ABR também mantêm certificação internacional da Better Cotton Initiative (BCI). #revistacultivar\n\nhttps://t.co/IvGy5rBhI8", "url": "https://x.com/RevistaCultivar/status/2113752336199746021"}, {"author_id": "1692398763396997120", "created_at": "2026-10-23T23:20:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113772631207870900"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Shen et al. found that one third of clinically unresponsive patients with acute brain injury were able to control a brain-computer interface, suggesting co", "display_url": "doi.org/10.1093/brain/…", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1093/brain/awag210", "images": [{"height": 398, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113643291887403008/n97mbfAl?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 520}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113643291887403008/n97mbfAl?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "Clinically unresponsive patients with acute brain injury activate a brain-computer interface", "unwound_url": "https://academic.oup.com/brain/advance-article-abstract/doi/10.1093/brain/awag210/8931697?redirectedFrom=fulltext", "url": "https://t.co/fm2wq0zNOZ"}]}, "id": "2113772631207870900", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Brain, yesterday (Columbia): bedside scalp-EEG BCI, 41 unresponsive ICU patients with acute brain injury. 13 (32%) moved a tone's pitch by attempting hand movement. Only 8 were CMD+ on the command test. 12-mo independence: 46% with control vs 7% without.\nhttps://t.co/fm2wq0zNOZ", "url": "https://x.com/AmericaGetBig/status/2113772631207870900"}, {"author_id": "1874847004347813888", "created_at": "2026-10-23T23:38:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113777135752212620"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Paradromics' Connexus® BCI enables the first participant to speak in real time using neural activity, choosing her own words to communicate.", "display_url": "paradromics.com/news/paradromi…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://paradromics.com/news/paradromics-achieves-real-time-speech-connexus-brain-computer-interface/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112166753199644672/vA60BYwy?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112166753199644672/vA60BYwy?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 232, "status": 200, "title": "Paradromics Achieves Real-Time Speech with Connexus® Brain-Computer Interface", "unwound_url": "https://paradromics.com/news/paradromics-achieves-real-time-speech-connexus-brain-computer-interface/", "url": "https://t.co/2iiKd342TK"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Oneob44rnq", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AbundTales/status/2113777135752212620/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113777110670057472", "start": 256, "url": "https://t.co/Oneob44rnq"}]}, "id": "2113777135752212620", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On this week's episode we talk about a brain implant that gave a woman her voice back in the Abundance Briefing.\n\nHer first sentence through Paradromics' Connexus BCI: \"Okay, I have a lot to say.\" Then she called her grandkids. 🧠📞\n\nhttps://t.co/2iiKd342TK https://t.co/Oneob44rnq", "url": "https://x.com/AbundTales/status/2113777135752212620"}, {"author_id": "58182556", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:11:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113740076316594340"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "Iran"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/BtKCNo5ddQ", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Kavehkhan/status/2113740076316594340/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113739914541989888", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/BtKCNo5ddQ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/BtKCNo5ddQ", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Kavehkhan/status/2113740076316594340/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113739941586890753", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/BtKCNo5ddQ"}]}, "id": "2113740076316594340", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impr